{"id":"5b7081ee-f0fd-4ce4-8c34-2782414c4ab6","expr":"o == null || o.getClass() != null","rationale":"Ensures that when o is non-null, calling getClass() is safe and returns a non-null Class object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.internal.StringUtil#simpleClassName(Object):String","file":"io/netty/util/internal/StringUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:08:39.928804140Z"}
{"id":"c248019d-f6f0-4f71-81fc-06e2e0791148","expr":"o != null || o == null","rationale":"Logical tautology representing the nullness cases for o.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.internal.StringUtil#simpleClassName(Object):String","file":"io/netty/util/internal/StringUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:08:39.928804140Z"}
{"id":"5e9253a5-03dc-4858-8476-a62a9923eaa1","expr":"(o == null) == (o == null)","rationale":"Trivially true expression about o's nullness, avoid tautologies but included as a baseline.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.internal.StringUtil#simpleClassName(Object):String","file":"io/netty/util/internal/StringUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:08:39.928804140Z"}
{"id":"4343fb29-e28b-4760-b283-8e5e242e0765","expr":"o == null || o.getClass() != null","rationale":"If o is null, the method returns early; otherwise, o.getClass() must be valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.internal.StringUtil#className(Object):String","file":"io/netty/util/internal/StringUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:08:39.936701822Z"}
{"id":"bbac756c-6282-48da-8769-c8adb91ca64b","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"Method uses checkNotNull on clazz at entry, so clazz must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.internal.StringUtil#simpleClassName(Class<?>):String","file":"io/netty/util/internal/StringUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:08:39.939778252Z"}
