{"id":"2a45ef0e-4d19-405b-880b-e67c29adf10f","expr":"(trimWhiteSpace && value.length() >= 0) || (!trimWhiteSpace)","rationale":"If trimWhiteSpace is true, the length is used to find first/last non-whitespace chars; else different indexing is used.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.internal.StringUtil#escapeCsv(CharSequence,boolean):CharSequence","file":"io/netty/util/internal/StringUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:08:39.967166844Z"}
{"id":"9c0a7c7f-5a6a-416e-8669-6a21e252ffed","expr":"(o != null) == (result.equals(o.getClass().getName()))","rationale":"The method returns the class name of the input object when it is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.internal.StringUtil#className(Object):String","file":"io/netty/util/internal/StringUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:08:39.969046812Z"}
