{"id":"aadf5e8f-6cfa-4dfe-ad9d-0dfafc419c3c","expr":"(trimWhiteSpace == false) || (result.length() <= value.length())","rationale":"If trimWhiteSpace is true, the result can be a subsequence with trimmed whitespace, hence length is less or equal to the original.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.internal.StringUtil#escapeCsv(CharSequence,boolean):CharSequence","file":"io/netty/util/internal/StringUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-08-31T05:08:39.971219931Z"}
